        "answer": {
          "short": "Tangent–secant product rule; $TD\\times TC$; tangent–secant product rule.",
          "worked": "The square of the length of a tangent from an external point equals the product of the intercepts of any secant from that point.\n$$\\begin{align*}TP^2&=TB\\times TA\\\\TP^2&=TD\\times TC\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $TB\\times TA=TD\\times TC$.",
